-- title:
--   Representability descends along a finite étale faithfully flat extension
-- statement:
--   Let $R$ be a commutative ring and $R'$ a commutative $R$-algebra that is finite as an $R$-module, étale over $R$ and faithfully flat as an $R$-module; write $s \colon \operatorname{Spec} R' \to \operatorname{Spec} R$ for the induced morphism. Let $G$ be a functor from the opposite of the category of schemes over $\operatorname{Spec} R$ to sets (in the universe $u+1$), and assume that for every object $T$ of this category $G$ satisfies the sheaf condition for the one-morphism presieve generated by the counit of the adjunction between base change along $s$ and composition with $s$ at $T$, i.e. for the single covering morphism $T \times_{\operatorname{Spec} R} \operatorname{Spec} R' \to T$. Let $X'$ be a scheme with a morphism $x' \colon X' \to \operatorname{Spec} R'$ and assume that the restriction of $G$ along the functor sending a $\operatorname{Spec} R'$-scheme to the underlying $\operatorname{Spec} R$-scheme is representable by the object $x'$ of the category of $\operatorname{Spec} R'$-schemes. Assume further that every finite subset of $X'$ is contained in an affine open subset of $X'$. Then there exist a scheme $X$, a morphism $f \colon X \to \operatorname{Spec} R$ representing $G$, and an isomorphism $e \colon X \times_{\operatorname{Spec} R} \operatorname{Spec} R' \cong X'$ with $x' \circ e = \mathrm{pr}_2$, i.e. an isomorphism over $\operatorname{Spec} R'$.
--
--   This is effective descent of representability along the finite étale faithfully flat covering $\operatorname{Spec} R' \to \operatorname{Spec} R$, in the form used to descend relative Picard-type functors: a sheaf for that single covering which is representable after base change to $R'$, by a scheme in which finite sets of points lie in affine opens, is already representable over $R$. It is applied in the construction of schemes representing relative sub-Picard functors by finite étale descent.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_AlgebraicGeometry_exists_representableBy_of_representableBy_restrict_finiteEtale.lean

import Mathlib

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
